    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re excited to share some news: Guardians of the Afterlife has a new name 'Judgement'.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why the change? As development progressed, we realized the heart of the story isn\u2019t about the guardians themselves, but about the experience of facing the consequences of your life\u2019s choices. Each decision you make in the afterlife shapes your journey as you step into fictitious Earth scenarios and uncover deeper truths about yourself.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game you\u2019ve been looking forward to remains the same, a rich, narrative-driven experience of mystery, morality, and self-discovery. Now, with a title that reflects the core of the story more than ever before.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life. Your choices. Now face the Judgement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life, your choices\u2014now face the Judgement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens when the story of your life is laid bare? In Judgement, a narrative-driven visual novel, you find yourself in the afterlife, where your every action, decision, and intention is weighed. The choices you made in life echo here, where truth is the only currency\u2014and the consequences are eternal.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980650/extras/6f8e1e0913e28c71bbfb2a207a581b54.poster.avif?t=1749086461\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980650/extras/6f8e1e0913e28c71bbfb2a207a581b54.webm?t=1749086461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980650/extras/6f8e1e0913e28c71bbfb2a207a581b54.mp4?t=1749086461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But how can the guardians judge who you truly were without knowing the real you? Their solution: send you back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980650/extras/1366025b614c08576fb864dc9f4a3703.poster.avif?t=1749086461\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980650/extras/1366025b614c08576fb864dc9f4a3703.webm?t=1749086461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980650/extras/1366025b614c08576fb864dc9f4a3703.mp4?t=1749086461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each guardian will transport you to a fictitious Earth scenario\u2014crafted to test your moral compass. One moment, you\u2019re on a date at a restaurant; the next, you\u2019re making a life-altering decision in a hospital hallway. With each choice, you reveal more of your nature. Upon returning, the guardians evaluate your actions before guiding you to the next trial. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980650/extras/08987df9bec019693795eaceac859c8e.poster.avif?t=1749086461\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980650/extras/08987df9bec019693795eaceac859c8e.webm?t=1749086461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980650/extras/08987df9bec019693795eaceac859c8e.mp4?t=1749086461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you seek redemption, cling to your regrets, or defy the forces that pass final judgment? The outcome is in your hands.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Storytelling: Your decisions shape the narrative, with multiple paths and endings.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moral Dilemmas: Face tough choices that challenge your understanding of right and wrong.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fictitious Earth Scenarios: Experience immersive, lifelike situations designed to test your character.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunting Atmosphere: Explore a mysterious afterlife where every moment feels like a revelation.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling Characters: Encounter enigmatic guardians who will test your resolve, and reveal truths you might wish stayed buried.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Life is over. But your story isn\u2019t. The Judgement awaits.</strong></i>  </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life, your choices\u2014now face the Judgement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens when the story of your life is laid bare? In Judgement, a narrative-driven visual novel, you find yourself in the afterlife, where your every action, decision, and intention is weighed. The choices you made in life echo here, where truth is the only currency\u2014and the consequences are eternal.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980650/extras/6f8e1e0913e28c71bbfb2a207a581b54.poster.avif?t=1749086461\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980650/extras/6f8e1e0913e28c71bbfb2a207a581b54.webm?t=1749086461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980650/extras/6f8e1e0913e28c71bbfb2a207a581b54.mp4?t=1749086461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But how can the guardians judge who you truly were without knowing the real you? Their solution: send you back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980650/extras/1366025b614c08576fb864dc9f4a3703.poster.avif?t=1749086461\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980650/extras/1366025b614c08576fb864dc9f4a3703.webm?t=1749086461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980650/extras/1366025b614c08576fb864dc9f4a3703.mp4?t=1749086461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each guardian will